No third-party dependencies: all code, artwork, and sound are original or
system-provided. The game ships as a single self-contained HTML file with no
external libraries, fonts, images, or audio files. Typefaces are system font
stacks, all art is inline SVG, and all sound is synthesized at runtime via the
Web Audio API.

No data is collected. All player data (decks, fight record, gauntlet runs, and
settings) is stored locally in the browser or in a profile file the player
chooses to export. There are no accounts, no analytics, and no servers.

